1
00:00:00,830 --> 00:00:03,380
Does it still hurt?

2
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:04,990
Same as always.

3
00:00:04,990 --> 00:00:06,050
I see.

4
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:07,050
At this rate,

5
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:10,050
I'm afraid I won't be able to perform.

6
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:11,550
I'm sorry.

7
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:12,430
Even you, Kaede-san...

8
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:14,430
I've made you push yourself too hard.

9
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:15,560
I'm fine.

10
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,520
The problem is Haru.

11
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:18,730
What?

12
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:19,850
What's wrong with Haru senpai?

13
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:21,770
Can't you tell?

14
00:00:21,770 --> 00:00:23,190
With me playing Viola,

15
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:25,360
he can't put his heart into it.

16
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:27,650
That can't be true.

17
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:28,740
I can see it.

18
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:31,780
After all, we've been working
together for a long time.

19
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:33,780
Haru's heart

20
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:35,580
is already completely filled with you.

21
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,580
What?

22
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:42,080
Picture in your mind

23
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:43,790
the person you love.

24
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:46,550
That's what Haru told you, right?

25
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:47,840
Yes.

26
00:00:48,210 --> 00:00:49,630
Then who do you think

27
00:00:49,630 --> 00:00:51,300
Haru is picturing

28
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,010
in his mind?

29
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:55,890
That's...

30
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:06,400
Minato...

31
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:08,490
I...

32
00:01:09,690 --> 00:01:11,030
The one Haru loves

33
00:01:11,330 --> 00:01:12,610
is you.
